Description:
WinSparkle's windows (the update prompt and progress) are drawn with
wxWidgets, linked statically into WinSparkle.dll from WinSparkle 0.9.4's
3rdparty/wxWidgets. The wxWindows Library Licence permits distributing the
binary under terms of the distributor's choice.

